    "0f374230-3b4b-4fb2-be91-37e4aba998e5": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "03a4c3ad-f533-4db3-8281-96386dc8e164": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In all cases where the highest quality ingredients are available in certified form, Orenda will use them. Orenda’s ingredient sources are predominantly non-GMO. We are in the process of closing this gap to 100% non-GMO. Check for the non-GMO listing on product labels.<\/p><p>We develop formulas based on established ingredient research, with premium, active, ingredients. <a href=\"https:\/\/pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\">PubMed<\/a> is your best resource for the latest supplement ingredient research.<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
